WEBVTT

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.510
I'm so hungry!

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:05.520
What are you getting?

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.620
Extracurriculars?

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:07.510
Yeah.

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:08.980
Why should we start now?

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.620
We have nothing to do after school and we're not working.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:16.220
When I come home early, my parents
pester me about homework.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.290
I like my free time. And I'm not
into physical activities anyway.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.310
You're too soft, Mitsuki.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:26.450
Um, that's mine.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.170
Soft as that fried egg!

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:33.070
It's going to get cold soon, and you'll put on weight if you don't exercise.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.390
You'll be a chubby! A true chubbynista!

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:41.370
You say you don't like it, but you're
actually pretty good at sports.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.870
No, that...

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:46.840
wasn't me.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:47.850
Huh? Say something?

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.180
Um, no.

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:51.910
But, can people still join clubs this late in the year?

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.800
They sure can.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.250
There are a lot of clubs that invite people for a look-see.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.730
So, we'll be going after school.

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.210
I'm taking care of the trash!

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:06.580
Ayaka can be weird sometimes.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.080
I'm totally against it!

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.110
Extracurriculars? No thank you!

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:13.410
Why? I thought you liked sports.

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:18.370
I don't <i>hate</i> them, but they'll get in the way of us getting busy with Onii-chan!

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:20.610
Nobody's getting busy.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:25.410
But if Ayaka's that into the idea, then I'm willing to go visit some clubs with her.

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:28.500
Only to visit! No joining up!

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:30.810
What?

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:33.420
You don't get fat, do you, Hiyori?

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.450
Well, I <i>am</i> a ghost.

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:38.990
That's not fair.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.710
Welcome to the girls' tennis team!

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:14.040
Nice to meet you!

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.050
Ditto.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.590
Why don't you get changed and hit a few?

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.860
Do you know the rules?

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.890
Yes. We played it in gym.
Hey, watch it!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:25.140
Yes. We played it in gym.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.390
Then how about we try some volleys?
Sorry!

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.260
Then how about we try some volleys?

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.760
Sure thing!

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:32.160
Um... it's kind of cold out here.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.370
We wear this during winter too.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:37.570
But don't worry, you'll warm up in no time!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:38.860
Right.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.110
Mitsuki! Here I go!

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.360
Okay!

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.580
Hey, can't you slow it down?!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:49.450
Come on, that was normal!

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.200
Now it's your turn, Mitsuki!

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:53.920
Uh, sure.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.220
Mitsuki! You okay?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.230
H-Hiyori,

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.260
switch places.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:16.480
No way! I'm against this all the way!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.210
I can't take... this.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:21.780
You need way more exercise.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.620
Fine, you win.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.200
Time to get this over with,

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.940
go home, and get cozy with Onii-chan!

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:32.540
We aren't getting cozy!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.290
Something wrong? Should we take a break?

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.210
There's no need for that.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.840
Let's hurry up...

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.260
go home...

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.180
and get busy!

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.600
Wow, did you see that?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.890
Oh my god, she's good!

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.390
She's that raw talent you get only once a decade.

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:01.110
With some polish, she can take us to the nationals!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:05.560
We're witnessing the birth of a Princess of Tennis!

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.950
Hmm, not bad.

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:19.040
I'm through with tennis.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:21.610
That felt good.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:25.010
Kanzaki-san!

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:25.760
Yes?

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:29.490
You have a very rare gift for tennis!

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.190
Please join our team!

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:33.470
Together we can go to Wimbledon!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.120
Tomorrow we'll...

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.400
No, starting today we are going to train!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:42.100
We'll run, build our muscles, and
do serves, smashes, and volleys!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:46.240
I'll beat the A to Z's of tennis into
you from morning till night!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.300
Yeah, um...

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.450
From this day forward, you will be a tennis machine!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:55.910
You will turn your back on school, love, and your entire youth, and chase after balls like a trained dog!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:56.940
Just like me!

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:57.510
Something went off inside our captain again.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.790
Don't worry! All good things in life can be found in tennis!

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.880
Come on, you're just creeping her out!

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:04.250
Now, sign your name on this application!

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.870
You should have joined.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.640
You know I can't.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.590
First of all, I don't even like tennis.

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:20.230
I wouldn't want to do that every day either.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.900
Let's visit other places!

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:24.020
Welcome to the girls' soccer team.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:28.360
Let me warn you that our team
<i>will</i> be taking on the world.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.360
It's nice to meet you.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:33.740
Kanzaki-san!

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.580
What am I... supposed to do?

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.420
Don't be afraid! The ball is your BFF!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.750
How'll that help?

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:42.710
My ball!

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.170
Oh, and that's payback for last time!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.340
Young lady, if you please.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.600
Ayaka!

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:57.560
Mitsuki?!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.330
And here's <i>my</i> payback!

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.520
No way!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:01.890
Yes way!

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.020
That girl...

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.660
Wow, that girl's...

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.780
the reincarnation of Maradona!

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.460
He's still alive, Captain.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.460
All right!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.520
That's amazing, Kanzaki-san!

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:31.970
You think so?

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.970
Join our team, and together we'll
go for the world championships!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:36.640
Sure!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.200
Hey! You don't get to decide!

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:42.420
But it'll be hot if I make it to the world championships!

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:45.770
Even Yuuya-<i>oniichan will have to congratulate me!</i>

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.480
I don't think making it will be that easy.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.920
That's great! Manager?

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:51.690
Here!

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:57.220
That's our club application. Please sign your name.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.080
Sure thing!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.550
And here's an enrollment form for the Soccer Association.

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:02.540
Okay!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:06.020
Here's a parental release form allowing you to come to training camp.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:08.490
This is an insurance form for our overseas games.

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:10.280
And this is the dorm application form.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:12.880
Also, here's the management contract.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.870
Wait a minute!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.090
What do you mean by dorms and overseas games?

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:20.890
I'm not living in a dorm. I can come here from home.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:25.090
Kanzaki-san, that attitude won't win us any games against world-class teams.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:26.960
But this is just an extracurricular!

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:30.610
I told you in the beginning that we'll be competing at the world level.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:34.820
It'll take a whole lot of effort to reach the top.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.550
The world championships will host the best players from each country.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:39.330
It's even...

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.290
a proxy war between nations!

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:48.660
Is every sports captain just as crazy?

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:51.710
Of course not. Let's try another one.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.590
Misakura, fight!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.950
Yeah!

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.300
We'll win the intermurals!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.050
Yeah!

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:04.310
Strike!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:09.610
Muscles are beautiful! Tomorrow
we'll turn you into a muscle lady!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.130
Next!

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:17.440
Clubs?

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:18.240
Yeah!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:21.270
When it comes to school, there are always clubs!

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:25.200
Doing stuff we're passionate about is all part of the blissful teenage school life.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:28.300
Let's aim for the Koshien, the Kokuritsu, and the Hanazono stadiums!

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:31.170
Oh, and also the Quiz Koshien and the Manga Koshien.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.100
How many are you planning to join?

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:35.500
And why now of all times?

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.100
I want to meet chicks!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:42.470
Especially those who are aiming for the same goals so I can get that much more intimate with them!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.240
That's no reason to join clubs.

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:49.660
I do agree that it's good to add
some stimulation to your life.

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:52.950
Oh yeah, are you doing any club activities, Neko?

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:55.440
I find myself very busy after school.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:58.630
I don't intend to add any more to my plate.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:00.880
Then you won't come with us?

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.910
No. Allow me to accompany you out of curiosity.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:08.130
Pay me no heed as you waste your youths on this pointless endeavor.

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:09.730
Yeah, don't mind her.

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:11.640
Not that I actually am.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.110
So what's the plan?

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:14.130
We're doing this!

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:16.340
Let's ship out!

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:19.180
I will become... the Club King!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.190
Oh?

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.810
So it was you guys who wanted to visit.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.380
Yukina-san, you're on the kendo team?

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:37.580
I haven't officially joined, but this school doesn't have many experienced players.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:39.840
So I sometimes come here to coach.

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:42.530
Everyone else is out jogging, unfortunately.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.740
So why don't I have you two grab some shinais.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:49.100
Ooh, the floor is so cold!

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.210
You can use our spare protective gear.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.140
Once you're ready, call me.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.470
Okay.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.030
Excuse us!

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:58.870
Why are <i>you</i> here?

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.300
Huh, Mitsuki?

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:01.880
Mitsuki, switch places!

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:02.970
Why?

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:07.560
This is my chance to kick Miss Funbags'
butt in front of Onii-chan!

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:09.930
Yukina-san?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.030
I would like to challenge you.

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:15.980
But we should focus on footwork first.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:20.200
Girls look nice when they wear hakamas.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.310
You think so?

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.660
Okay. I accept.

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:34.210
Has Mitsuki-chan practiced kendo before?

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:36.750
No, not that I've heard.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:42.640
Miss Funbags, I will make you pay for trying to seduce Onii-<i>chan in front of me!</i>

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.260
Ew, this reeks!

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.600
What the hell is this?!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.560
I don't believe this! Don't they clean this stuff?

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:52.300
What's wrong? Should we quit?

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:53.520
Be quiet!

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.850
I'm coming!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.240
Okay, you can attack me in any fashion.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:04.660
What are you doing, Hiyori?!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.600
Is that the fabled Drunken Sword?

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:08.170
You know about that, Torii?

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:12.620
I've read it in <i>Sakigake!! Blade of the Rurouni.</i>

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:15.130
If you're not coming, then I will!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.190
Hey, Yukina-san is coming!

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.010
I can't take the stink!

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.050
<i>Men!</i>

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:27.410
Whoa! Yuki-nee was always this good at kendo!

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:29.250
Is this a good time to be impressed?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:34.400
Mitsuki-chan?

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.110
You okay, Mitsuki?

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.870
Hey, stay with me!

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.320
What were you doing? She's a total amateur!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.780
No, I didn't hit her that hard.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.740
It's so good to be alive.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.910
I'm still a little dizzy.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.400
Are you okay?

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.920
Yuki-nee's <i>men</i> can hit you where it hurts.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:58.380
She used to do the same to me when we were little.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:01.700
She did apologize, so you can forgive her.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.850
No, she's not the one I'm mad at.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.220
On the <i>other</i> hand...

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:10.930
There's this thing I have to do!

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:12.680
What is it?

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.890
Nothing.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:17.270
Anyways, Ayaka, I'm through with sports clubs.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:20.660
Yeah, me too. I guess they're not the right fit.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.230
How about an artsy club?

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.840
Hey, why don't we come with?

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:26.530
No. We're good.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.280
Let's go, Ayaka.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.040
Sure.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.320
What should we try next?

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:35.160
Something more laid back, I hope.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.750
Mitsuki!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.100
There go my two bishoujos!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.750
I wanted to make the rounds and flirt with them!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:45.260
God. Quit lusting after my sister.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.540
I'm lusting after her <i>because</i> she's your little sister!

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:49.510
If she were <i>my</i> little sister-

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.260
Onii!
If she were <i>my</i> little sister-

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.040
Yow!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:56.590
What are <i>you</i> doing here?! This is a high school!

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:59.120
Huh? Didn't you read my text?

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:02.480
I came to get my house key you took by mistake!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.190
What are you, dumb?

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:07.530
Huh? <i>You're</i> the one who put it in the wrong place!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.320
But <i>you</i> messed up, Onii!

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:12.440
You're Torii's younger sister? It's been a while.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:14.230
Ah, Neko-senpai!

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:17.970
Thank you for giving me those pool tickets!

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:19.290
So, um...

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.870
Torii Moa!

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.070
Thanks for looking after my dumb brother!

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.640
Don't add the "dumb" part!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.580
And that means you're dumb since we share genes!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.880
God, screw off.

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:31.940
Did you see that, Yuuya?! Her face? Those words?

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:34.880
Please, let me trade this <i>thing</i> in for Mitsuki-chan!

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.020
I'd like that!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:39.850
As my older brother, he'd be a billion times better!

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:14.410
I got this!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.670
Oh, it's you two again.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.420
What are you guys doing?

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:25.560
Rehearsing, of course.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.900
Why is Yuuya-senpai on stage?

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.920
It appears the drama club has no male members.

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:34.370
So they've compelled him to take
the stage when we came to visit.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.640
What is this play about?

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:41.720
It's a love story about a certain man who can't decide between his girlfriend and his younger stepsister.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.760
It looks like they mean business.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.980
I despise taking half-measures.

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.720
We always go for the jugular.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.250
We even have enough people in the audience.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:59.050
Yeah.

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:04.740
Hey. How are things going with her?

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:09.550
Oh, yes? What are you talking about?
Things are going well.

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:11.400
Onii-chan!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.390
Let's go home, Onii-chan!

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.710
Hey, let go of me!

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:19.950
Come on, what's the harm?
I'm your sister, after all!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:24.700
The stepsister is being played by Torii's little sister.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:27.310
Also, I'm the one who'll be playing his girlfriend.

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:28.920
His girlfriend?

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:32.380
You two are related, what's with the PDA?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.390
Besides, you have a girlfriend, don't you?!

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:37.100
Indeed.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.930
Who do you choose: me or your sister?

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.270
You're putting me on the spot here.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:45.630
I trust you are smart enough
to make the right decision.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:51.090
His peaceful life was turned upside down by the arrival of his new stepsister.

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:54.240
She was toying with our hero like a playful tigress,

00:16:54.240 --> 00:17:00.490
but he was still caught up in a cyclone of passion, which shot his logic straight above the stratosphere!

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:03.210
I was also the one who wrote the script.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.890
H-How could this be possible?

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.880
I have a girlfriend,

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:12.380
but I can't stop thinking about my own sister!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.610
Do you understand, little sister of his?

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:18.470
He has a girlfriend, so leave
him alone and go out with me.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:19.980
Ew, that's gross.

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:21.370
This is a play, <i>moron.</i>

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.510
I didn't like that line either, <i>moron.</i>

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:25.690
Now quit stalling, <i>moron.</i>

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:28.150
Wow, such raw emotions!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:31.980
Hah! All the other guys I know are complete idiots!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:35.180
And this halfwit here is the dumbest of them all!

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:36.860
Shut up, moron.

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:40.840
But, I really love hanging out with you, Onii-chan!

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.200
H-Hey, let go!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.490
Onii-chan! Onii-chan! Onii-chan! Onii-chan!

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:48.650
"Onii-<i>chan"? She's not even his real sister.</i>

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:54.290
Our hero is now set adrift in a sea of his own ruin.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:59.280
This worried his girlfriend, who
rowed toward him in a lifeboat.

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:02.150
Marry me.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:02.810
Sure.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.270
Wow, what a shocking twist.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:07.090
You're marrying her?

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:09.550
Onii-chan, you jerk!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:14.430
You've made the right decision.

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:18.180
Believe you me, she's not worth it.

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:23.200
She's nothing but a haughty,
two-faced, self-important brat!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.550
There's nothing to be gained
from hooking up with her!

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:28.610
That little...

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:32.370
Thus the cyclone of love turned into a
mere low-pressure system of romance,

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:34.960
until it was thought to be completely extinguished.

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:37.340
That's stupid.

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:38.850
Mitsuki?

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:42.930
They'll only be miserable if that's
how they end up together.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.730
Here we are on the day of the wedding.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:55.130
The two of them were joined by the red string—or rather the red chain of fate

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:59.200
at a church while wedding bells rang out their blessings.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:02.070
Why am I playing every bit role?

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.660
Don't ask me!

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:06.370
They don't have any male actors anyway.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.860
Uh, lessee...

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:09.520
Here comes the bride!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.210
Huh? Wasn't she supposed to wear a gown?

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:17.210
What are you doing? Now I'm the only one in an embarrassing costume!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:19.170
I am sorry.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.500
I have realized how you truly feel.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:26.470
Please find happiness with your true love.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.230
Hey, wait!

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:29.140
Huh, what's going on?

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:30.600
Go!

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:35.650
So he ends up with his sister at
the eleventh hour? Unbelievable.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.400
Then what about the script?

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:41.320
Come on! I've never done this before!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.550
Now you're asking too much!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.410
Moa-chan.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:48.400
No.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:52.500
Quit drooling over someone who isn't your sister!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:53.540
Mitsuki?

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.670
I was supposed to play that part!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:57.250
Hey, let her have this one.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.760
Let me go!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.290
Another love interest?

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.100
This is getting good!

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:04.350
So this is now a love trapezoid?

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.220
Was this in the script?

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.600
Let me go, now!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.440
Hey, you need to switch places with me!

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:17.550
Yeah!

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:18.280
All right!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.120
Noooo!

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:37.840
Just a dream?

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:39.810
But why?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.510
You awake?

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:44.430
Dinner is ready.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.940
Hey, nobody asked you to come in...

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:51.390
Are you ready to dig in before it all cools down?

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:54.350
Wait, why are you looking at me like that?

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.580
N... N...

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.060
Noooo!

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:03.890
Another dream?

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:06.420
What were you dreaming about, honey?

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:09.530
Oh, it was this really awful dream...

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.750
Was I perhaps in that dream, honey?

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.120
Nooo!

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:27.160
God, what a sick joke.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.410
I know that horrible thing happened, but cheer up!

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:44.840
Yuuya-<i>senpai's also pretending he didn't see it, so everything's cool!</i>

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:46.990
Okay, see you at school!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.810
Please hug me tight.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.410
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:59.290
Come closer to me.

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.170
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:15.490
I want you to notice

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:18.730
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:21.030
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:24.190
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:26.560
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.780
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:32.040
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:35.120
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.750
These ordinary days

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.630
are something special to me.

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:46.130
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:51.850
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:57.270
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:57.270 --> 00:22:59.980
You’re my man with the charming do

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.760
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:05.470
Well you see, that’s because

00:23:05.470 --> 00:23:08.490
I love you very much.

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:11.030
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.700
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:16.570
I want to keep on loving you

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:19.200
always and forever more.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:23.960
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual:</i>

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:25.210
I see.

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:28.550
Oh yeah, huge racks
are where it's at!

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:32.390
Those ittie-bitties are turning into middie-bitties!

00:23:32.390 --> 00:23:36.220
But they... really tickle.

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:39.980
There's a chance we may
have met here before.
